{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact","id":25939,"title":"Existing mortal characters \"becoming\" Unchained during play (via soul pact)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-08T12:06:38-08:00","id":25939,"title":"Existing mortal characters \"becoming\" Unchained during play (via soul pact)","content":"So I am currently running a GMC mortals game. The story takes the group on a road trip across America, discovering the existence of the God-Machine, and chasing down leads on its machinations in various locations across the country, running into various supernatural activity along the way. Yes, it was heavily inspired by Supernatural. Anyway, the idea was originally for the plot to culminate in the characters following the trail back to Seattle (the characters' home city, and where it all started) and running the Sister City scenario from the GMC book. Then I read the writeup on Seattle in D:tD, and it seems like the perfect segue into a Demon game (which I wanted to run next anyway). My question is, would it be possible for the players to create Demon characters, and have their mortal characters enter soul pacts with them to become their new characters' first Cover? How could this be implemented, given that as new Demon characters, they couldn't have multiple covers? Would they have to appear in full demon form to offer the contract? Or should they discard their old cover once the pact is made? More importantly though, what to do with the merits the mortal characters already have? Should they apply only to those covers, or to the Demons? Or just disappear? I'm leaning towards letting mental and social merits carry over to the Demon and having physical skills remain linked to the cover, but I would be interested in hearing others' thoughts both on this situation specifically, and on mortals &quot;becoming&quot; unchained during play in general.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T13:37:27-08:00","id":26007,"title":"","content":"I suppose its doable though I'm not sure how I'd feel about having a demon take my old character's soul and wear my former character as person-suit even I was running the new demon character. Its along the lines of transitioning to Promethean by saying all your characters die in a car crash and these new characters wake up wearing your faces (and perhaps retianing your skills and stuff).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/463-derendel","name":"Derendel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar463_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T13:42:52-08:00","id":26009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Derendel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact?p=26007#post26007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I suppose its doable though I'm not sure how I'd feel about having a demon take my old character's soul and wear my former character as person-suit even I was running the new demon character. Its along the lines of transitioning to Promethean by saying all your characters die in a car crash and these new characters wake up wearing your faces (and perhaps retianing your skills and stuff).</div> </div> </div> </div> Oh, I wouldn't force the change on them. I'm merely offering it as an opportunity to continue playing their current characters (in a manner of speaking) when we transition to Demon. For anyone to whom that idea appeals - and I know it does to at least one of them - I will work it into the plot. Anyone who would prefer to simply retire their mortals and create a new character for Demon may do so at the same amount of experience their mortal had.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-08T16:56:46-08:00","id":26138,"title":"","content":"I can definitely see how the idea would not appeal to some, but I really like it. Replacing someone whose life and history is already well known to the participants is a really good way to put an exclamation point on the identity issues that thread through Demon. It's also an exciting opportunity as an ST to squeeze the characters through a really impossible wringer without the worry that you're dicking the players over.<br /> <br /> As far as the actual execution, I'd say have the player(s) who want to do it design the demon, or at least come up with key details, now, to help you work in the necessity for the soul pact and why their demon was in he right place at the right time to offer it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T00:17:48-08:00","id":26346,"title":"","content":"That's a good point, plus it will give me extra time to work on their Ciphers and Interlocks and such. I'll probably have them get started on that next session.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T06:32:22-08:00","id":26464,"title":"","content":"If I was a demon, I wouldn't be too keen on taking a cover that might already be into scrutiny by the God Machine.<br /> <br /> Then there's the problem of the complete re-conceptualization of the characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T11:45:57-08:00","id":26634,"title":"","content":"I'm not really interested in reasons not to do it that way, as that's what I'm planning to do and my group thinks its a cool idea. What I was more interested in was suggestions on how to implement the mechanical changes. Right now I'm thinking a new character sheet with its own attributes, skills, merits, etc. But any merits purchased during play either carry over to the Demon or are redistributed via sanctity of merits rule. Any character creation only merits like Ambidextrous, Giant, or Small-Framed remain part of the cover. Does that seem appropriate? Any other suggestions on how to improve the idea?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T14:50:47-08:00","id":26748,"title":"","content":"Based strictly on what the game tells us, the Demons wouldn't have their characters memories, which really might make them only tangentially related. If you houserule otherwise, I'd suggest keeping their skill arrangements as-is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T15:19:51-08:00","id":26757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact?p=26748#post26748\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Based strictly on what the game tells us, the Demons wouldn't have their characters memories, which really might make them only tangentially related.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is, mind, the possibility that the soul-pacting demon had Mind Reading and/or Memory Theft as form powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T16:19:31-08:00","id":26796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact?p=26757#post26757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is, mind, the possibility that the soul-pacting demon had Mind Reading and/or Memory Theft as form powers.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm also curious about the uses of Legend. I argue that, on some level, skills and merits reflect character knowledge as well as external assets. Thus, I think that a demon could use Legend to temporarily gain a memory from the soul-pacted mortal their Cover was made from. Agree or disagree?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1231,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1231-gapb","user":"gapb","date":".  rephrasing 12-09-2013, 07:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1231-gapb","name":"gapb","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T17:07:20-08:00","id":26832,"title":"","content":"I actually chose this option in one of my current games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T17:22:54-08:00","id":26843,"title":"","content":"And one of the things that fascinates me about the idea is actually playing the bug wearing the Edgar Suit made out of my former character, essentially relearning how to play them. The lack of knowledge of the old character's inner workings is itself something that can be played interestingly.<br /> <br /> Experimental suggestion: ask the players who are interested in continuing that way if they might want to actually trade off which Demon gets which identity. I'd be fascinated to see the result if that went through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T18:54:37-08:00","id":26894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact?p=26832#post26832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually chose this option in one of my current games.</div> </div> </div> </div> Glad I'm not the only one who's attempted it. How did that work out for you? What character elements of the mortal, if any, carried over to the Demon? @squidheadjax: That's a pretty cool idea. I'll bring it up when we make the new characters, but I think I would only allow it if the player whose former character was being used as another player's cover gave permission.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T19:28:11-08:00","id":26920,"title":"","content":"Y'know, it'd be fascinating to have a bunch of players who played mortal characters switch and play demons playing the other people in the group's characters. So if Joe and Marylou played Jimmy and Wayne as mortals respectively, then Marylou plays Jimmy and Joe plays Wayne. That'd be a trip.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-09T20:48:05-08:00","id":26971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact?p=26894#post26894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Glad I'm not the only one who's attempted it. How did that work out for you? What character elements of the mortal, if any, carried over to the Demon?</div> </div> </div> </div>It worked out rather well. just a little of the original characters traits were transferred over. My demon only wanted her to replace the coroded business woman cover she started with after spending much more time as an elementary school girl.<br /> <br /> What I'm liking about it is, when my character assumes the form of my first character, one of the players whose character knew the old char, has become stigmatic. the interaction between that will be fun.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T09:06:39-08:00","id":27232,"title":"","content":"I had, in the past, an alternate thought as to how Pacts and Cover would work.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> Basically, when a demon makes a pact he or she would inherit a small portion of the mortal in a mechanic sense (think a modified Professional Training- two dots of Skills to allocate to either one or two skills and a Merit to represent the career) once the identity is assumed. The demon is still housing the person inside itself and uses the vestiges within to keep the Cover alive externally and in the fabric of reality. To that end, the demon uses what memories it has to keep relationships going. The more a demon works with the claimed mortal in maintaining the life, the more real and well regulated will the Cover become.</div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">I'm not familiar with how ghosts work completely though and maybe that's too Geisty. If that sounds at all interesting, I'll try to elaborate. I'm green though. What I'm suggesting might not be workable or desirable.</div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T11:27:28-08:00","id":27339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact?p=26920#post26920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Y'know, it'd be fascinating to have a bunch of players who played mortal characters switch and play demons playing the other people in the group's characters. So if Joe and Marylou played Jimmy and Wayne as mortals respectively, then Marylou plays Jimmy and Joe plays Wayne. That'd be a trip.</div> </div> </div> </div> I do like this idea, but for obvious reasons, Joe and Marylou would each have to be cool with the other taking over a character they had put a lot of time into.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T11:59:23-08:00","id":27367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact?p=26971#post26971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My demon only wanted her to replace the coroded business woman cover she started with after spending much more time as an elementary school girl.</div> </div> </div> </div> You were creepy staring girl, right? I really wanted to follow that up but things started exploding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-10T14:46:36-08:00","id":27544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>squidheadjax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/25939-existing-mortal-characters-becoming-unchained-during-play-via-soul-pact?p=27367#post27367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> You were creepy staring girl, right? I really wanted to follow that up but things started exploding.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> but I was in the immediate area.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}